{
    "title": "My GPS Coordinates",
    "description": "Get your current GPS coordinates even faster!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccd Pinpoint Precision with High Accuracy GPS: Discover your exact coordinates, altitude, GPS precision, and satellite count, ensuring you're always on the mark.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Flexible Coordinate Formats: Tailor your experience with multiple latitude and longitude formats (DD decimal degrees, DDM degrees and decimal minutes, DMS degrees, minutes and seconds sexagesimal , UTM Universal Transverse Mercator, MGRS Military Grid Reference System) to suit your needs.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 Snapshot Memories: Capture the moment and location with a photo, complete with all GPS details artistically displayed.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Personalize Your Memories: Customize your geo-tagged photos by adjusting the position, color, and size of the location data overlay.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccc Bookmark Your Adventures: Save any location with the option to attach a photo, perfect for revisiting those special spots.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udccf Distance Units of Your Choice: Whether you prefer metric or imperial, choose the unit that makes sense for you.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Unmatched Location Accuracy: Rely on the app\u2019s superior accuracy to pinpoint your exact position.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Map View of Saved Locations: Visualize all your saved spots on a user-friendly map interface.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Effortless Location Search: Easily find locations by address \u2013 simplicity at its best.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce4 Instant Location Sharing: Share your current whereabouts quickly and effortlessly.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Organized Memories: Filter your saved locations by date, distance, or keywords for easy access.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 In-App Learning Hub: Get to know the app better with the helpful in-app guidance function.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udded Compass Navigation to Saved Spots: Let the built-in compass guide you back to your saved locations.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Versatile Data Export and Import: Use GPX, KML, or the custom MYGPS format for comprehensive data management, including photos.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udd98 Lifesaving SOS Feature: Send an SOS message with your coordinates in emergencies, customizable with a preset number and message.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd03 Customizable Sorting Options: Sort your saved locations by name, date, or proximity to your current position.\r\n\r\n\u2699\ufe0f Adjustable Location Accuracy Mode: Choose your desired balance between precision and battery consumption.\r\n\r\n\u231a Seamless Watch Integration: Save locations using your Wear OS watch and sync seamlessly with your phone.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d Diverse Map Choices: Switch between normal, terrain, hybrid, and satellite maps for diverse viewing options.\r\n\r\nOur app comes with a brand new application for Wear OS devices. You can easily save your current location without using your phone and synchronize data afterwards to enjoy viewing your saved locations on a bigger screen!\r\n\r\nInternet connection is not needed but it's helpful to get better accuracy.\r\nGet your current GPS coordinates even faster!\r\n\r\nData is based on WGS84.\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nAccuracy depends on the quality of GPS hardware in your device as well as outside weather conditions. Be aware that GPS does not work well indoors, so try to use it outside most of the time.",
